{"unit_id":"jsdvjx__dsh-strata#card-zh","repo":"jsdvjx/dsh-strata","commit":"50b128aea6d8dc9e5d493f852302c2e6577daf81","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-strata 是面向 DSH Web 的会话地图插件。它在对话区滚动条槽位加入按真实行高缩放的彩色轨道，把用户消息、模型回复、工具调用、命令、重试、失败和上下文压缩显示为不同色块，并以视口框标出当前阅读位置。用户可以点锚点跳到消息或失败处，拖动轨道浏览长会话，也能查看全会话提示词、切换地图尺度并自动载入更早历史。插件适合需要快速理解和定位长对话运行过程的 DSH Web 用户；安装命令为 dsh plugin --profile web add dsh-strata，无需额外 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:487-503","client.js:1491-1507","client.js:1766-1795","client.js:2376-2383","client.js:3563-3600"]}
{"unit_id":"jsdvjx__dsh-strata#card-en","repo":"jsdvjx/dsh-strata","commit":"50b128aea6d8dc9e5d493f852302c2e6577daf81","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-strata adds a proportional, color-coded map to DSH Web chats, showing messages, replies, tools and failures by row height. Click anchors, drag to scrub, view prompts, change scale and load older history. Install with `dsh plugin --profile web add dsh-strata`.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:487-503","client.js:1491-1507","client.js:1766-1795","client.js:2376-2383","client.js:3563-3600"]}
