{"unit_id":"jsdvjx__dsh-strata#feature-feature-map","repo":"jsdvjx/dsh-strata","commit":"50b128aea6d8dc9e5d493f852302c2e6577daf81","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-strata 的功能「会话地图」：在 DSH Web 聊天滚动区旁按每行真实渲染高度画出比例轨道，并以颜色区分用户消息、回复、工具、命令、重试、失败和压缩点。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:487-503","client.js:1580-1644","client.js:1931-2016"]}
{"unit_id":"jsdvjx__dsh-strata#feature-feature-anchors","repo":"jsdvjx/dsh-strata","commit":"50b128aea6d8dc9e5d493f852302c2e6577daf81","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-strata 的功能「锚点跳转」：轨道旁显示用户消息、失败和压缩边界锚点；点击锚点或色带可滚到对应行。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:1766-1834","client.js:3080-3110"]}
{"unit_id":"jsdvjx__dsh-strata#feature-feature-scrub","repo":"jsdvjx/dsh-strata","commit":"50b128aea6d8dc9e5d493f852302c2e6577daf81","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-strata 的功能「轨道浏览」：拖动视口框或点击空轨道按比例浏览会话，也支持滚轮和键盘控制滚动位置。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:695-697","client.js:3111-3170","client.js:3359-3375"]}
{"unit_id":"jsdvjx__dsh-strata#feature-feature-wall","repo":"jsdvjx/dsh-strata","commit":"50b128aea6d8dc9e5d493f852302c2e6577daf81","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-strata 的功能「提示词线索墙」：悬停用户锚点可查看本会话提示词卡片，卡片可分页展示并连接到对应锚点。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:2376-2405","client.js:2529-2676","client.js:2823-2926"]}
